tion-equivalent; instrument=live-call — Child ticket records and Gerrit change records show Verified +1 before every repository merge.\n- [x] [non-codebase] The GitHub metadata child passes plan review before close.\n      provenance: environment=origin/tickets; principal=RebarBotNava/joeoakhart@navapbc.com; privilege_posture=production-equivalent; instrument=live-call — The closed F20 ticket contains its signed plan-review attestation before its close event.\n- [x] [non-codebase] The GitHub metadata child receives exact readback verification before close.\n      provenance: environment=github.com/navapbc/rebar; principal=RebarBotNava/joeoakhart@navapbc.com; privilege_posture=production-equivalent; instrument=live-call — The F20 ticket records exact description, topics, and homepage readback before close.\n- [x] [non-codebase] The repository batch is merged to `main`.\n      provenance: environment=origin/main@ce496143; principal=RebarBotNava/joeoakhart@navapbc.com; privilege_posture=production-equivalent; instrument=live-call — Git history found all nine repository leaf trailers on origin/main.\n- [x] [non-codebase] Every descendant closes without force.\n      provenance: environment=origin/tickets; principal=RebarBotNava/joeoakhart@navapbc.com; privilege_posture=production-equivalent; instrument=live-call — Rebar listed every direct child and all three F19 leaves as closed without a forced transition."}},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"EDIT","timestamp":1787495120659773001,"uuid":"0e2b0228-312a-457d-b5a9-68c526b017ac"}